<title>FRANCE: Lagardere 1996 sales rise.</title>
<headline>Lagardere 1996 sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					56,300    vs   52,579</p>
<p>     - high technologies			19,489    vs   16,098</p>
<p>     - auto and transport			3,716    vs    5,765</p>
<p>     - communications/media		   33,019    vs   30,644</p>
<p>NOTE - Lagardere SCA issued its 1996 sales in a statement. It said they were up 7.1 percent. On a like-for-like basis, the sales rise was 5.3 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
